From: Eldin Lee <eldin.lee@quantatw.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 20:21:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] implement analog valve control for VT2 inventory

- Add AnalogValve class with ADC feedback and DAC control
- Support I2C device probing for hardware configuration
- Integrate analog valves alongside existing GPIO valves
- Add hardware mapping for SupplyValve2_{1,2,3} devices
- Include GPIO reporting for valve close status
- Extract shared utility functions to ValveUtils module
- Use 180 LPM as the default open point, mapped to the
  corresponding control voltage in the 2-10V range
  based on the 0-333 LPM specification

Signed-off-by: Eldin Lee <eldin.lee@quantatw.com>
